WEBVTT

00:16.539 --> 00:18.541
<i>There's someone I'm dying to see.</i>

00:25.715 --> 00:27.383
<i>I'm Taiki Inomata.</i>

00:27.467 --> 00:29.552
<i>A first year at Eimei Private High School.</i>

00:31.345 --> 00:34.640
<i>I fell in love with a girl named Chinatsu,
who is a second year.</i>

00:36.517 --> 00:38.686
Starting in the spring,
she'll be living with us.

00:39.729 --> 00:40.772
Yes, thank you.

00:41.606 --> 00:45.151
I told him. I told Taiki that I like him.

00:45.902 --> 00:46.903
I can't...

00:47.945 --> 00:49.030
go out with you.

00:49.113 --> 00:52.158
A tracksuit!
I've been wanting to go buy a new one!

00:52.241 --> 00:53.785
<i>It's a date!</i>

00:53.868 --> 00:55.745
<i>This is my chance</i>

00:55.828 --> 00:57.997
<i>to tell her how I feel.</i>

00:58.706 --> 01:01.375
<i>In front of the planters...
In front of the planters...</i>

01:24.065 --> 01:28.694
BLUE BOX SEASON 2

02:51.068 --> 02:55.698
EPISODE 26 DÉJÀ VU

03:12.089 --> 03:14.008
Maybe in the badminton section?

03:14.091 --> 03:16.510
Or should we check in apparel?

03:19.597 --> 03:22.266
Hey. Taiki, why don't we try
the second floor?

03:22.350 --> 03:23.267
Oh, sure.

03:28.606 --> 03:30.399
<i>I've never actually</i>

03:30.483 --> 03:32.485
<i>invited her to hang out with me.</i>

03:33.444 --> 03:34.779
<i>So that would make today</i>

03:34.862 --> 03:36.781
<i>our first "real date."</i>

03:37.365 --> 03:39.742
Can the two of us go somewhere?

03:39.825 --> 03:42.286
There's a cafe that I've been
wanting to stop by.

03:42.370 --> 03:43.788
Can we go check it out?

03:43.871 --> 03:45.706
<i>A café, huh?</i>

03:47.375 --> 03:49.293
<i>There are so many different sports...</i>

03:50.878 --> 03:53.589
<i>which means so many kinds of sportswear...</i>

04:04.350 --> 04:05.184
<i>Focus!</i>

04:05.268 --> 04:06.686
<i>I'm getting carried away...</i>

04:07.436 --> 04:08.980
Taiki.

04:10.147 --> 04:11.148
SQUID

04:11.232 --> 04:12.441
What about this one?

04:15.444 --> 04:16.988
You can't be serious.

04:17.071 --> 04:18.197
Of course, I am!

04:18.281 --> 04:21.033
- Well, would you wear something like that?
- Nuh-uh.

04:21.117 --> 04:23.369
So you only picked it
'cause it's not for you!

04:23.452 --> 04:25.746
I guess that's a no.

04:27.957 --> 04:29.375
BIG CATCH

04:31.335 --> 04:33.629
<i>She's acting so comfortable with me!</i>

04:34.338 --> 04:35.381
Ta-da!

04:37.383 --> 04:39.510
Ta-da!

04:44.724 --> 04:46.851
Okay then, how's this?

04:48.394 --> 04:49.895
Ah. This could work.

04:50.479 --> 04:51.480
Mmm.

04:52.189 --> 04:53.566
I think it looks great.

04:55.526 --> 04:58.404
But they have it in a larger size,
just in case...

05:02.825 --> 05:04.452
I'm buying this one!

05:04.535 --> 05:07.330
Man, tracksuits sure are the coolest,
aren't they?

05:08.205 --> 05:10.124
Maybe I'll get myself this T-shirt.

05:10.207 --> 05:12.001
- Uh...
- I'll go try it on.

05:12.668 --> 05:13.711
Okay!

05:18.799 --> 05:20.634
<i>She's in the fitting room...</i>

05:20.718 --> 05:22.720
<i>Wait, is it okay for me to be here?</i>

05:22.803 --> 05:26.057
<i>Maybe she'll want to show me
after she puts it on?</i>

05:26.932 --> 05:28.934
<i>I guess I'll stay close by...</i>

05:35.274 --> 05:36.567
<i>This size is perfect.</i>

05:38.235 --> 05:39.862
<i>I'll ask Taiki what he thinks.</i>

05:40.738 --> 05:41.864
Huh?

05:41.947 --> 05:43.699
If it isn't Inomata!

05:44.200 --> 05:45.826
Uh, Yokomura...

05:45.910 --> 05:47.161
What a coincidence!

05:47.244 --> 05:49.121
Are you buying clothes for volleyball?

05:50.039 --> 05:50.873
Oh.

05:51.749 --> 05:52.917
Women's shoes?

05:54.543 --> 05:56.420
A-ha! A girl!

05:56.504 --> 05:58.381
You almost snuck one past me, man.

05:58.464 --> 06:00.216
Well then, best of luck to you!

06:00.299 --> 06:01.133
No, that's not...

06:01.717 --> 06:03.969
Ah, don't worry, dude.
I won't tell anyone.

06:04.053 --> 06:04.929
Uh, thanks.

06:05.012 --> 06:06.889
- Before I leave you and your lady to it,
- Hmm?

06:06.972 --> 06:08.140
I have one question.

06:08.808 --> 06:09.892
Is it Chono?

06:11.811 --> 06:12.728
Huh?

06:13.479 --> 06:16.273
Sorry, not my place to pry. See ya!

06:17.483 --> 06:19.819
<i>So that's what people think.</i>

06:21.362 --> 06:23.155
<i>We are close, I suppose.</i>

06:38.295 --> 06:39.672
<i>She's not wearing it.</i>

06:39.755 --> 06:41.132
How'd it fit?

06:41.215 --> 06:43.384
Oh, um, It was a little too big.

06:44.468 --> 06:45.594
Gotcha.

06:46.345 --> 06:48.013
I can buy one some other time.

06:48.639 --> 06:51.142
Okay, let me go pay for this real quick.

06:51.725 --> 06:53.894
I can't wait to go to that café!

06:54.645 --> 06:55.646
Yeah.

07:18.377 --> 07:20.045
It's pretty close, right?

07:20.129 --> 07:21.464
Yeah, it is.

07:21.547 --> 07:23.799
Nagisa and I went there together once.

07:23.883 --> 07:25.801
<i>So she's been there before.</i>

07:25.885 --> 07:27.636
And they have apple pie.

07:27.720 --> 07:30.556
I swear, it's gotta be
one of the best apple pies I've ever had.

07:31.182 --> 07:33.309
I want you to try a slice, Taiki.

07:35.394 --> 07:38.481
Then, there's something
I want you to try too, Chinatsu!

07:38.564 --> 07:39.815
Let's go there next time!

07:40.441 --> 07:42.318
Okay.

07:51.076 --> 07:52.328
Welcome!

07:53.829 --> 07:54.705
A table for--

07:55.289 --> 07:56.457
two!

07:56.540 --> 07:58.000
Are you here alone?

07:58.083 --> 07:59.710
You can join us if you want.

08:00.336 --> 08:01.879
Matsuoka?

08:04.048 --> 08:05.716
Natsu!

08:08.719 --> 08:10.638
Fancy meeting you in a place like this.

08:10.721 --> 08:12.723
- Must be fate.
- What a loser.

08:12.806 --> 08:15.059
Natsu, why don't you sit by me?

08:15.142 --> 08:16.310
It is pretty crowded.

08:17.186 --> 08:19.230
- Huh?
- Hmm?

08:20.481 --> 08:22.816
- And your fan?
<i>- It's Inomata...</i>

08:22.900 --> 08:24.985
He could see me the whole time!

08:25.861 --> 08:27.988
Uh-huh. Hang on.

08:28.072 --> 08:29.698
What's he doing here?

08:33.744 --> 08:35.329
Oh really, Natsu?

08:35.412 --> 08:38.999
You can't come to a café by yourself,
so you drag this fan along?

08:39.083 --> 08:41.377
Uh, I can come by myself.

08:41.961 --> 08:43.254
Anyway, take a seat.

08:44.213 --> 08:45.339
- Hmm?
- Mmm.

08:48.175 --> 08:49.885
<i>I can't figure this guy out.</i>

08:50.803 --> 08:53.180
<i>At first, I thought
he was kind of a jerk but...</i>

08:53.264 --> 08:54.890
I gotta use the bathroom real quick.

08:54.974 --> 08:55.933
Oh, okay.

08:56.016 --> 08:58.394
<i>Maybe he's just an airhead
who can't read the room.</i>

09:04.650 --> 09:05.901
Well, fan,

09:05.985 --> 09:07.403
here's your chance.

09:08.028 --> 09:09.029
Huh?

09:15.744 --> 09:17.538
<i>That's it...</i>

09:17.621 --> 09:21.250
<i>This guy is a total jerk!</i>

09:24.503 --> 09:27.172
Oh, maybe I didn't make myself clear.

09:27.256 --> 09:30.926
I'm asking you to leave
and don't come back, got it?

09:31.010 --> 09:33.095
<i>Is he giving me orders now?</i>

09:34.471 --> 09:36.807
That's what I should be asking you!

09:36.890 --> 09:40.936
For your information, I made plans
to hang out with Chinatsu today!

09:41.020 --> 09:41.854
Huh?

09:41.937 --> 09:43.772
- You're the one who--
- Hey, I'm back.

09:45.316 --> 09:47.026
Hey. Welcome back.

09:47.109 --> 09:48.694
<i>Don't fall for it, Chinatsu!</i>

09:48.777 --> 09:51.614
<i>There's pure evil
hiding behind that innocent smile!</i>

09:51.697 --> 09:54.241
You've got that suspicious look
on your face again.

09:54.325 --> 09:55.367
You're so mean!

09:55.451 --> 09:57.369
<i>Is this a thing with them?</i>

09:57.453 --> 09:58.537
Natsu, whatcha gonna order?

09:58.621 --> 10:00.164
Apple pie and black tea.

10:00.247 --> 10:02.333
A black tea kinda girl, huh?

10:02.416 --> 10:04.710
I have seen you drink it a lot in class.

10:04.793 --> 10:06.920
<i>Oh, come on! Everybody knows that!</i>

10:07.004 --> 10:08.213
Excuse me!

10:08.297 --> 10:10.674
- So, what are you gonna order?
- Um...

10:10.758 --> 10:12.551
Some protein?

10:12.635 --> 10:14.178
<i>He's making fun of me!</i>

10:15.054 --> 10:18.307
I'll take Chinatsu's recommendation
and get black tea and apple--

10:18.390 --> 10:19.808
- By the way, I think
- Hmm.

10:19.892 --> 10:21.894
you and I came here
when we were in junior high.

10:21.977 --> 10:23.646
<i>Excuse you!</i>

10:23.729 --> 10:27.232
Some folks from basketball
met up together after practice, right?

10:27.316 --> 10:29.068
Sorry to keep you waiting.

10:29.151 --> 10:32.363
I think we'll have
two of each of these, please.

10:32.446 --> 10:34.031
- Certainly.
- Mmm-hmm.

10:34.114 --> 10:35.824
That really takes me back.

10:35.908 --> 10:38.035
Remember that fancy place we went to?

10:38.118 --> 10:39.370
- Yeah, that's right.
- Huh?

10:39.453 --> 10:41.372
The café on 2nd Street.

10:41.455 --> 10:43.374
Taiki have you heard of that one?

10:43.457 --> 10:44.500
Oh, is that...?

10:44.583 --> 10:48.128
That was a bit out of the price range
for junior high school students.

10:48.212 --> 10:52.716
Nagisa tried to act all cool
by ordering herself an espresso.

10:52.800 --> 10:54.510
Actually, that was Yumeka.

10:54.593 --> 10:55.678
Oh...

10:58.347 --> 10:59.431
<i>The mood just shifted...</i>

10:59.515 --> 11:01.433
Oh, was it?

11:01.517 --> 11:03.352
Oh yeah, and when we tried to get home,

11:03.435 --> 11:05.270
- it was a total disaster.
<i>- Who's Yumeka?</i>

11:08.357 --> 11:09.817
Sorry again for the wait.

11:13.612 --> 11:15.948
Whoa.

11:23.706 --> 11:24.540
Mmm!

11:24.623 --> 11:28.293
<i>The flakey crust and sweet apple
are in perfect harmony!</i>

11:30.379 --> 11:31.588
Oh...

11:32.381 --> 11:33.507
- Oh, and then...
- Mmm.

11:36.760 --> 11:38.220
It's so good!

11:39.888 --> 11:41.140
Hmm.

11:42.141 --> 11:42.975
Huh?

11:46.145 --> 11:47.813
Hmm.

11:56.697 --> 11:57.656
Well, then.

11:59.324 --> 12:00.576
Where should we go next?

12:01.452 --> 12:02.828
Hang on!

12:02.911 --> 12:05.330
- Now that we got some food in us,
- Hey!

12:05.414 --> 12:06.790
how about we go bowling?

12:08.667 --> 12:10.461
I think I forgot something.

12:10.544 --> 12:11.795
I'll be right back!

12:15.299 --> 12:17.801
<i>We were finally gonna be alone again...</i>

12:24.683 --> 12:28.061
You don't have time
for a relationship, do you?

12:28.145 --> 12:29.229
Huh?

12:29.313 --> 12:31.064
That confused face again.

12:31.148 --> 12:32.983
<i>He's doing this on purpose.</i>

12:33.066 --> 12:34.568
- What I mean is--
- Huh?

12:35.319 --> 12:37.738
Don't you need to focus on badminton?

12:44.995 --> 12:46.830
Just the other day,

12:46.914 --> 12:48.999
you lost a match to Haryu.

12:49.082 --> 12:50.834
You've been losing a lot, right?

12:51.752 --> 12:53.754
Compared to the other club members,

12:53.837 --> 12:56.131
you don't seem particularly good.

12:57.341 --> 13:00.135
I, on the other hand,
am really good at basketball,

13:00.219 --> 13:03.055
so balancing the two
is just easier for me.

13:05.182 --> 13:06.809
I can balance them too.

13:09.770 --> 13:10.813
Really?

13:15.943 --> 13:17.611
Sorry that took so long.

13:17.694 --> 13:19.571
No worries, we were just chatting.

13:23.158 --> 13:25.077
<i>He hit me right where it hurts.</i>

13:25.953 --> 13:27.704
<i>I'm literally sweating.</i>

13:28.330 --> 13:29.623
<i>But...</i>

13:29.706 --> 13:31.834
<i>I made up my mind to not worry about stuff</i>

13:32.417 --> 13:33.669
<i>that hasn't happened yet.</i>

13:34.670 --> 13:36.505
Hey, uh, Matsuoka?

13:36.588 --> 13:38.090
Hang on, I got a text.

13:39.341 --> 13:41.635
Oh, that's perfect timing!

13:41.718 --> 13:44.096
Apparently, some seniors
from Yusei University

13:44.179 --> 13:46.098
are having a practice.

13:46.181 --> 13:47.599
We should go, Natsu.

13:48.225 --> 13:49.601
Huh?

13:52.187 --> 13:54.857
Yusei is a basketball powerhouse.

13:54.940 --> 13:56.859
I think you could learn a lot from them.

13:57.442 --> 13:58.443
Yeah, but...

14:00.487 --> 14:03.323
They told me I should invite
whoever I want so...

14:04.449 --> 14:06.493
You should go, Chinatsu!

14:08.829 --> 14:12.666
There's gotta be a ton you can gain
from practicing with college students!

14:12.749 --> 14:14.042
Oh, and...

14:14.126 --> 14:16.003
I'm fine, don't worry about me!

14:16.086 --> 14:19.756
Besides, I can head home
and get some practice in too!

14:23.260 --> 14:25.429
Well you heard the man. Let's go.

14:25.512 --> 14:26.847
All right, off we go.

14:27.556 --> 14:29.016
Come on, we gotta hurry.

14:29.099 --> 14:29.975
But I--

14:30.058 --> 14:31.435
Right this way.

14:32.978 --> 14:34.479
See you later, fan boy.

14:34.563 --> 14:37.482
<i>I'm not doing this for you, you know!</i>

14:57.336 --> 15:00.005
<i>There was another place
I wanted to take her.</i>

15:03.842 --> 15:06.637
<i>But I have to support
Chinatsu's basketball too.</i>

15:08.597 --> 15:11.516
<i>I could compete with that
Matsu-what's his face all day.</i>

15:16.104 --> 15:18.732
<i>But it wouldn't do Chinatsu any good.</i>

15:27.908 --> 15:28.825
Huh?

15:45.801 --> 15:47.928
I thought you had gotten on the train.

15:48.595 --> 15:50.097
I went to the bathroom.

15:51.098 --> 15:54.601
Uh-- Wait. What are you doing here?
The practice!

15:57.604 --> 16:01.358
After catching my breath, I realized
I wasn't dressed for the occasion.

16:08.532 --> 16:10.033
Then let's head home!

16:13.954 --> 16:15.163
<i>I'm glad.</i>

16:16.373 --> 16:17.833
<i>I'm glad she came back,</i>

16:18.834 --> 16:20.502
<i>and we can go home together.</i>

16:21.837 --> 16:23.255
<i>But happy as I am,</i>

16:24.047 --> 16:25.716
<i>there's still a lot I need to do.</i>

16:26.842 --> 16:29.177
- Excuse me, Nagisa?
- Hmm?

16:29.261 --> 16:31.805
I was cleaning up
and found this old team photo.

16:31.888 --> 16:34.391
Who's the person wearing number four?

16:34.474 --> 16:35.559
Oh, that girl.

16:36.393 --> 16:37.644
Yumeka Kido.

16:42.232 --> 16:44.484
The apple pie was delicious, wasn't it?

16:44.568 --> 16:46.319
It was the best I've ever had!

16:46.403 --> 16:48.530
I'm glad.

16:48.613 --> 16:50.824
Today went by way too fast, didn't it?

16:51.616 --> 16:53.118
Yeah. It really did.

16:53.910 --> 16:56.329
NEXT STOP OMOTESANDO

16:57.622 --> 16:59.332
- Hey, Chinatsu?
- Hmm?

16:59.416 --> 17:02.586
Why don't we make today last a bit longer?

17:04.671 --> 17:05.505
Hmm?

17:09.676 --> 17:12.596
I know a spot that's perfect
for this time of day.

17:27.444 --> 17:28.779
It's beautiful.

17:29.613 --> 17:31.615
We got here at the perfect moment.

17:32.866 --> 17:36.119
Uh-huh. It feels like time
is slowing down somehow.

17:37.037 --> 17:39.873
<i>I wish time would stop altogether!</i>

17:42.709 --> 17:44.336
It's breathtaking.

17:44.419 --> 17:45.504
Yeah, it sure is.

17:52.427 --> 17:54.679
Honestly, I'm a little surprised.

17:55.222 --> 17:58.517
I would have never guessed that you'd know
about a place like this.

17:58.600 --> 18:00.560
Well... Um...

18:01.061 --> 18:06.024
<i>It's not like I've been furiously
researching since the day we made plans.</i>

18:06.108 --> 18:08.193
- Any chance...
- Uh-- Yes?

18:09.069 --> 18:10.862
You brought a girl here?

18:10.946 --> 18:13.240
A girl?! No way!

18:13.323 --> 18:15.826
No, this is my first time here!

18:15.909 --> 18:18.745
I wasn't even sure
if we'd have time to stop by today!

18:21.832 --> 18:24.251
Hmm?

18:26.002 --> 18:28.505
Well, anyway, it's my first time too.

18:30.215 --> 18:31.508
Until now,

18:31.591 --> 18:34.469
I thought going to these places
was just a way to slack off.

18:35.345 --> 18:36.304
Huh?

18:36.972 --> 18:38.265
<i>Who's Yumeka?</i>

18:38.348 --> 18:41.768
You wouldn't know her
since you started at Eimei in high school.

18:44.813 --> 18:47.149
What's the matter?
Jealous you can't spin the ball?

18:47.232 --> 18:51.027
Yumeka was the most annoying
teammate I ever had!

18:52.529 --> 18:54.531
And yet, she was a genius.

18:55.240 --> 18:57.826
<i>She and Chinatsu
played youth basketball together</i>

18:57.909 --> 18:59.536
<i>and were always in perfect sync.</i>

19:01.288 --> 19:03.331
- Oh.
- But then--

19:03.415 --> 19:06.168
Yeah, she quit once we got to high school.

19:07.419 --> 19:08.920
<i>Without telling anyone why.</i>

19:09.588 --> 19:11.006
She quit Eimei

19:11.089 --> 19:12.424
and basketball.

19:22.517 --> 19:24.769
Wait, are you cold?

19:24.853 --> 19:26.438
Mmm-mmm. I'm fine.

19:28.857 --> 19:30.025
You can wear this.

19:30.734 --> 19:31.985
My new tracksuit!

19:32.068 --> 19:34.070
It should help block the wind. Oh!

19:34.154 --> 19:36.448
I should have hand warmers in my bag!

19:37.032 --> 19:39.075
My mom gave them to me.

19:39.159 --> 19:42.329
Hang on, I think
they're in this pocket, maybe...

19:42.412 --> 19:43.830
Hmm.

19:47.042 --> 19:48.210
Uh, what is it?

19:51.713 --> 19:54.090
Nothing, it's just... deja vu.

19:54.174 --> 19:55.383
Oh.

19:56.927 --> 19:58.220
Ah, um!

19:58.303 --> 20:00.722
If you'd like you can wear my scarf!

20:00.805 --> 20:02.349
It's fresh from the laundry.

20:02.432 --> 20:03.642
Oh?

20:03.725 --> 20:05.977
And then, I have hot tea.

20:06.770 --> 20:09.272
This thermos is really good
at keeping things warm!

20:09.356 --> 20:10.649
And also I have gloves and a--

20:10.732 --> 20:11.900
hand-warmer!

20:11.983 --> 20:13.860
It heats when you shake it...

20:16.988 --> 20:19.741
Looking back, it must've seemed creepy.

20:19.824 --> 20:23.119
An underclassman you didn't know
randomly offering a scarf...

20:23.954 --> 20:26.414
- I was a little surprised.
- Huh?

20:29.793 --> 20:32.170
But I wouldn't say
I thought it was creepy or anything.

20:33.171 --> 20:34.673
Even though we'd never spoke,

20:34.756 --> 20:36.841
we saw each other at morning practices.

20:42.430 --> 20:45.684
So I had a feeling
that you were honest, hardworking,

20:46.393 --> 20:48.812
and overall, just a good person.

20:58.446 --> 21:00.991
I'm just wondering
what you're going to offer me next.

21:10.083 --> 21:11.209
I'm just kidding.

21:17.465 --> 21:20.760
I don't have anything to give you,
but I do...

21:22.804 --> 21:25.223
have something to tell you, Chinatsu.

21:27.809 --> 21:28.977
- Natsu?
- Huh?

21:38.069 --> 21:39.112
Yumeka.

21:40.572 --> 21:42.282
<i>That name from earlier?</i>

21:45.076 --> 21:47.996
No way. I can't believe it.

21:48.079 --> 21:50.999
Natsu finally got herself a boyfriend.

21:51.082 --> 21:52.542
Hold on.

21:52.625 --> 21:53.752
I'm not her...

21:55.128 --> 21:56.254
Well...

21:57.797 --> 22:00.759
I thought basketball
was all you cared about.

22:00.842 --> 22:03.845
But look at you, falling in love.

22:08.058 --> 22:09.559
That means...

22:11.561 --> 22:14.981
...you've decided to give up on basketball.
